            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1.5">What is wrong with this value, as a sentence, or "" when nothing is.  An empty required field is not wrong yet. A form that opens already shouting at the person who has not typed in it is a form that has decided they were going to get it wrong; `o["submitted"]` is what says they have had their turn,</p>
        </div>
<div class="p-4 bg-[#171412] overflow-x-auto">
<pre><code class="language-soli text-sm">error = field_error(value, fn(said) { true }, "", o)</code></pre>
